{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778978802991,"sessionID":"ses_1cc99dda3ffeNddS6qPMsHeMRV","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_Nfpzv8hK8egqNWPw8UGnUDYI","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/__issue_context__.json","offset":1,"limit":400},"output":"<path>/__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/__issue_context__.json</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: {\n2:   \"body\": \"Please check that the term does not already exist by using the ontology search tool OLS:\\nhttps://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/ontologies/cl\\n\\n\\n**Preferred term label**\\nprehypertrophic chondrocyte\\n\\n**Synonyms** (add reference(s), please)\\npreHTC - related synonym - abbreviation - PMID: [31871141](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31871141/)\\n\\n**Definition** (free text, with reference(s), please. PubMed ID format is PMID:XXXXXX)\\n\\nA post-proliferative chondrocyte in the prehypertrophic zone of the cartilage tissue, located between the proliferative and hypertrophic zones. This cell is characterised by increased cell volume and expression of Indian Hedgehog (Ihh), PTH1R, and Runx2/3 in both humans and mice (Hallett et al., 2021). It coordinates the PTHrP-Ihh feedback loop that regulates chondrocyte differentiation and functions as a signalling hub for communication between proliferative chondrocytes, hypertrophic chondrocytes, and periosteal osteoblasts (Hallett et al., 2021). \\n\\nPMID: [31871141](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31871141/)\\nPMID: 29985449\\nPMID: [34137454](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34137454/)\\n\\n**Parent cell type term** (check the hierarchy here https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/ontologies/cl)\\nchondrocyte\\n\\n**Anatomical structure where the cell type is found** (check Uberon for anatomical structures: https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/ontologies/uberon)\\ndevelops directly into 'hypertrophic chondrocyte'\\n\\n**Your ORCID**\\nhttps://orcid.org/0009-0000-8480-9277\\n\\n**Additional notes or concerns**\\n\\n\",\n3:   \"comments\": [],\n4:   \"title\": \"NTR - Prehypertrophic chondrocyte (preHTCs)\",\n5:   \"url\": \"https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3460\"\n6: }\n\n(End of file - total 6 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"{\n  \"body\": \"Please check that the term does not already exist by using the ontology search tool OLS:\\nhttps://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/ontologies/cl\\n\\n\\n**Preferred term label**\\nprehypertrophic chondrocyte\\n\\n**Synonyms** (add reference(s), please)\\npreHTC - related synonym - abbreviation - PMID: [31871141](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31871141/)\\n\\n**Definition** (free text, with reference(s), please. PubMed ID format is PMID:XXXXXX)\\n\\nA post-proliferative chondrocyte in the prehypertrophic zone of the cartilage tissue, located between the proliferative and hypertrophic zones. This cell is characterised by increased cell volume and expression of Indian Hedgehog (Ihh), PTH1R, and Runx2/3 in both humans and mice (Hallett et al., 2021). It coordinates the PTHrP-Ihh feedback loop that regulates chondrocyte differentiation and functions as a signalling hub for communication between proliferative chondrocytes, hypertrophic chondrocytes, and periosteal osteoblasts (Hallett et al., 2021). \\n\\nPMID: [31871141](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31871141/)\\nPMID: 29985449\\nPMID: [34137454](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34137454/)\\n\\n**Parent cell type term** (check the hierarchy here https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/ontologies/cl)\\nchondrocyte\\n\\n**Anatomical structure where the cell type is found** (check Uberon for anatomical structures: https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/ontologies/uberon)\\ndevelops directly into 'hypertrophic chondrocyte'\\n\\n**Your ORCID**\\nhttps://orcid.org/0009-0000-8480-9277\\n\\n**Additional notes or concerns**\\n\\n\",\n  \"comments\": [],\n  \"title\": \"NTR - Prehypertrophic chondrocyte (preHTCs)\",\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3460\"\n}","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"__issue_context__.json","time":{"start":1778978802975,"end":1778978802989}},"id":"prt_e33664cc9001iPsJGMG43Erjn1","sessionID":"ses_1cc99dda3ffeNddS6qPMsHeMRV","messageID":"msg_e33662380001ZZa7I50Kl2Psta"}}
