{"type":"text","timestamp":1778978845423,"sessionID":"ses_1cc99dda3ffeNddS6qPMsHeMRV","part":{"id":"prt_e3366deda001A2nqP3OfGunejX","messageID":"msg_e3366c7e1001gUkykz0u8atkji","sessionID":"ses_1cc99dda3ffeNddS6qPMsHeMRV","type":"text","text":"The references support a growth-plate prehypertrophic population distinct from hypertrophic chondrocytes, and the issue’s synonym source is weakly aligned with meniscus usage. I’m choosing a conservative ontology placement under `growth plate cartilage chondrocyte` with a `part_of` restriction to the prehypertrophic zone, and I’ll keep the abbreviation as a related synonym with the supplied PMID.","time":{"start":1778978840282,"end":1778978845420}}}
