{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778978869715,"sessionID":"ses_1cc99dda3ffeNddS6qPMsHeMRV","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"webfetch","callID":"call_hfTIZ5qju7GfweHyh3VD0NOk","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"url":"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/api/search?q=prehypertrophic&ontology=cl","format":"text","timeout":60},"output":"{\"response\":{\"docs\":[{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0020022\",\"ontology_name\":\"cl\",\"related_synonyms\":[\"preHTC\"],\"ontology_prefix\":\"CL\",\"short_form\":\"CL_0020022\",\"description\":[\"A post-proliferative chondrocyte in the prehypertrophic zone of the cartilage tissue, located between the proliferative and hypertrophic zones. This cell is characterised by increased cell volume and expression of Indian Hedgehog (Ihh), PTH1R, and Runx2/3 in both humans and mice (Hallett et al., 2021). It coordinates the PTHrP-Ihh feedback loop that regulates chondrocyte differentiation and functions as a signalling hub for communication between proliferative chondrocytes, hypertrophic chondrocytes, and periosteal osteoblasts (Hallett et al., 2021).\"],\"label\":\"prehypertrophic chondrocyte\",\"obo_id\":\"CL:0020022\",\"type\":\"class\"},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0020018\",\"ontology_name\":\"cl\",\"related_synonyms\":[\"ProFC\"],\"ontology_prefix\":\"CL\",\"short_form\":\"CL_0020018\",\"description\":[\"A fibrochondrocyte located in fibrocartilage that exhibits active proliferation capacity and is in S phase of the cell cycle. It functions as a progenitor cell positioned at the root of developmental trajectories alongside fibrochondrocyte progenitors (FCP), with the capacity to diverge toward one of two developmental fates: (1) fibrochondrocytes and prehypertrophic chondrocytes, or (2) regulatory chondrocytes and prehypertrophic chondrocytes. It is characterised by co-expression of COL1A1, the growth factors FGF7 and CTGF, and the cell-cycle genes STMN1, KIAA0101, and MCM3 in humans. During early progenitor differentiation, FGF7 and COL1A1 expression increases and then declines as the cell commits to terminal fates.\",\"Lineage relationships are inferred from single-cell RNA-seq trajectories and validated through experimental approaches, including FACS isolation, functional differentiation assays, and in vivo developmental gene expression analysis.\"],\"label\":\"proliferative fibrochondrocyte\",\"obo_id\":\"CL:0020018\",\"type\":\"class\"}],\"numFound\":2,\"start\":0},\"responseHeader\":{\"QTime\":25,\"status\":0},\"facet_counts\":{\"facet_fields\":{\"ontologyPreferredPrefix\":[\"CL\",\"2\",\"ADDICTO\",\"0\",\"ADO\",\"0\",\"AEO\",\"0\",\"AFO\",\"0\",\"AGRO\",\"0\",\"AISM\",\"0\",\"AMPHX\",\"0\",\"APO\",\"0\",\"APOLLO_SV\",\"0\",\"ARO\",\"0\",\"AfPO\",\"0\",\"BAO\",\"0\",\"BCIO\",\"0\",\"BCO\",\"0\",\"BFO\",\"0\",\"BMONT\",\"0\",\"BSPO\",\"0\",\"BTO\",\"0\",\"CAO\",\"0\",\"CARO\",\"0\",\"CCF\",\"0\",\"CCO\",\"0\",\"CDAO\",\"0\",\"CDNO\",\"0\",\"CHEBI\",\"0\",\"CHEMINF\",\"0\",\"CHIRO\",\"0\",\"CHMO\",\"0\",\"CIDO\",\"0\",\"CIO\",\"0\",\"CLAO\",\"0\",\"CLO\",\"0\",\"CLYH\",\"0\",\"CMO\",\"0\",\"CMPO\",\"0\",\"COB\",\"0\",\"COLAO\",\"0\",\"COVOC\",\"0\",\"CPONT\",\"0\",\"CRO\",\"0\",\"CTENO\",\"0\",\"CVDO\",\"0\",\"DDANAT\",\"0\",\"DDPHENO\",\"0\",\"DHBA\",\"0\",\"DIDEO\",\"0\",\"DISDRIV\",\"0\",\"DMBA\",\"0\",\"DOID\",\"0\",\"DRON\",\"0\",\"DUO\",\"0\",\"EC\",\"0\",\"ECAO\",\"0\",\"ECO\",\"0\",\"ECOCORE\",\"0\",\"ECTO\",\"0\",\"EDAM\",\"0\",\"EFO\",\"0\",\"EMAPA\",\"0\",\"EMI\",\"0\",\"ENM\",\"0\",\"ENSGLOSS\",\"0\",\"ENVO\",\"0\",\"EPIO\",\"0\",\"EUPATH\",\"0\",\"EXMO\",\"0\",\"ExO\",\"0\",\"FAO\",\"0\",\"FBbi\",\"0\",\"FBbt\",\"0\",\"FBcv\",\"0\",\"FBdv\",\"0\",\"FIDEO\",\"0\",\"FLOPO\",\"0\",\"FMA\",\"0\",\"FOBI\",\"0\",\"FOODON\",\"0\",\"FOVT\",\"0\",\"FYPO\",\"0\",\"GALLONT\",\"0\",\"GAZ\",\"0\",\"GECKO\",\"0\",\"GENEPIO\",\"0\",\"GENO\",\"0\",\"GEO\",\"0\",\"GNO\",\"0\",\"GO\",\"0\",\"GSSO\",\"0\",\"GeXO\",\"0\",\"HANCESTRO\",\"0\",\"HAO\",\"0\",\"HBA\",\"0\",\"HCAO\",\"