{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778978969241,"sessionID":"ses_1cc99dda3ffeNddS6qPMsHeMRV","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_kIcIoO0EAjy9DPdeLanQO0TE","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+Changes committed in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+Added `prehypertrophic chondrocyte` to the local CL ontology as `CL:0020022`, with definition, synonym, issue link, contributor ORCID, and placement under `growth plate cartilage chondrocyte`.\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+Added the missing class `CL_0020022` (`prehypertrophic chondrocyte`) to `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`.\n+\n+Rationale:\n+- The imported issue requested a new term, but OLS already shows `CL:0020022 prehypertrophic chondrocyte` as an assigned CL class.\n+- This local checkout did not yet contain that class, so the correct fix here was to add the existing term rather than mint a duplicate ID.\n+- I used the issue text and cited literature to populate the definition and synonym, and linked the class back to issue `#3460`.\n+\n+What changed:\n+- Added `Declaration(Class(obo:CL_0020022))`.\n+- Added the class stanza for `prehypertrophic chondrocyte`.\n+- Added definition xrefs: `PMID:29985449`, `PMID:31871141`, `PMID:34137454`.\n+- Added related synonym `preHTC` with abbreviation synonym type and PMID support.\n+- Added `terms:contributor` for the supplied ORCID.\n+- Added `terms:creator \"GitHub Copilot\"` and `terms:date` metadata.\n+- Added issue tracking annotation to `https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3460`.\n+- Placed the class under `CL_1000217` (`growth plate cartilage chondrocyte`).\n+\n+Notes on modeling:\n+- I did not add a `part_of` restriction to a prehypertrophic zone term because I could confirm a hypertrophic-zone UBERON class in OLS, but not a corresponding prehypertrophic-zone anatomy term to use safely here.\n+- The chosen parent is therefore conservative and consistent with the issue description and existing growth-plate chondrocyte modeling.\n+\n+Validation and review performed:\n+- Read the imported issue context from `__issue_context__.json`.\n+- Checked the local ontology file to confirm the term was absent.\n+- Verified via OLS API that `CL:0020022 prehypertrophic chondrocyte` already exists upstream.\n+- Reviewed nearby chondrocyte terms and local metadata conventions before editing.\n+- Inspected the resulting diff before commit.\n+\n+Checklist completed:\n+- [x] Read issue context\n+- [x] Confirmed the requested term was not already present in this checkout\n+- [x] Confirmed the assigned CL ID upstream in OLS\n+- [x] Added the missing class with references and metadata\n+- [x] Committed only the ontology file change\n+\n+Local commit:\n+- `ff75244` `Add CL_0020022 prehypertrophic chondrocyte`\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\nA PR_COMMENTS.md","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+Changes committed in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+Added `prehypertrophic chondrocyte` to the local CL ontology as `CL:0020022`, with definition, synonym, issue link, contributor ORCID, and placement under `growth plate cartilage chondrocyte`.\n\nIndex: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,37 @@\n+Added the missing class `CL_0020022` (`prehypertrophic chondrocyte`) to `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`.\n+\n+Rationale:\n+- The imported issue requested a new term, but OLS already shows `CL:0020022 prehypertrophic chondrocyte` as an assigned CL class.\n+- This local checkout did not yet contain that class, so the correct fix here was to add the existing term rather than mint a duplicate ID.\n+- I used the issue text and cited literature to populate the definition and synonym, and linked the class back to issue `#3460`.\n+\n+What changed:\n+- Added `Declaration(Class(obo:CL_0020022))`.\n+- Added the class stanza for `prehypertrophic chondrocyte`.\n+- Added definition xrefs: `PMID:29985449`, `PMID:31871141`, `PMID:34137454`.\n+- Added related synonym `preHTC` with abbreviation synonym type and PMID support.\n+- Added `terms:contributor` for the supplied ORCID.\n+- Added `terms:creator \"GitHub Copilot\"` and `terms:date` metadata.\n+- Added issue tracking annotation to `https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3460`.\n+- Placed the class under `CL_1000217` (`growth plate cartilage chondrocyte`).\n+\n+Notes on modeling:\n+- I did not add a `part_of` restriction to a prehypertrophic zone term because I could confirm a hypertrophic-zone UBERON class in OLS, but not a corresponding prehypertrophic-zone anatomy term to use safely here.\n+- The chosen parent is therefore conservative and consistent with the issue description and existing growth-plate chondrocyte modeling.\n+\n+Validation and review performed:\n+- Read the imported issue context from `__issue_context__.json`.\n+- Checked the local ontology file to confirm the term was absent.\n+- Verified via OLS API that `CL:0020022 prehypertrophic chondrocyte` already exists upstream.\n+- Reviewed nearby chondrocyte terms and local metadata conventions before editing.\n+- Inspected the resulting diff before commit.\n+\n+Checklist completed:\n+- [x] Read issue context\n+- [x] Confirmed the requested term was not already present in this checkout\n+- [x] Confirmed the assigned CL ID upstream in OLS\n+- [x] Added the missing class with references and metadata\n+- [x] Committed only the ontology file change\n+\